{"time": 1753427212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384076069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，看来脚印就是她们留下的。\"同样看见了两人，玩心渐起，\"我说，要不要吓唬吓唬她们。\""}
{"time": 1753427362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372546491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么吓）"}
{"time": 1753427424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787805507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...先造一片大雾?然后去神社里装神弄鬼?\"语调欢快，\"感觉可有意思\""}
{"time": 1753427467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785088978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你怎么造（）"}
