{"time": 1753605686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005673699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=580954420]“咕唔……？”夏弥眨眨眼，不知有意无意地舔舔嘴唇，看起来倒是也不在意旁边有人的样子"}
{"time": 1753605771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094765478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好啦...这是让苦味都飞走的魔法。”收回身子脑袋偏向一侧，自顾自地喝自己的一份冷饮，“接下来...进洞穴吧。”"}
{"time": 1753605785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569236189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1095623790]（好惨）"}
