{"time": 1753605907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708979863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不记得了，只记得羊肉+绿豆会腹泻）"}
{"time": 1753606028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967938041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094765478]“真的有那种魔法？”沧澜看着准备进洞的两人，略微侧过头一些看露儿“怎么看都只是……简单的身体接触”"}
{"time": 1753606074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616911120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...也不懂..可能只是安姐姐单纯想和夏弥姐姐接触吧”"}
{"time": 1753606207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667792387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（说起来好像还带了赫萝，人机，jpg）"}
{"time": 1753606223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575693985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她觉得不说话装高手很帅）"}
{"time": 1753606343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581006772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616911120]“但是你也想和我接触，也没这么干过”沧澜收回目光，顺着山洞向里看。甬道中段漆黑一片，偶有突出的岩石能照到些许火光，透露出道路的轮廓。甬道尽头则是火光的来源"}
{"time": 1753606373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546820656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个要更亲密才可以干吧...”"}
{"time": 1753606558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065271352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=546820656]“我大概知道，但是不明白原因”"}
{"time": 1753606617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230644121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么原因？我会努力解释的”有点流汗了，因为自己也不怎么懂"}
{"time": 1753606745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518257356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=230644121]“不同部位的身体接触有什么区别？”"}
{"time": 1753606771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318584489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯哼？”心情很好地哼着小调子，牵着夏弥走进洞穴，“赫萝走前面吗？这里可以随意发挥哦，当然有好好喝冷饮吗？”"}
{"time": 1753606879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101469958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点烧脑了“emm，让我组织一下语言”"}
{"time": 1753607161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260919221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=318584489]“我不需要那种东西，我的温度不比火低”赫萝没伸手，不过还是走在前面"}
{"time": 1753607225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556054992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘴硬啦。”把冷饮塞到她手里，“要好好喝哦？我会看着的。”点头"}
{"time": 1753607526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069933201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1753607546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866356181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1556054992]“……你才嘴硬，我真不用”"}
{"time": 1753607735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32398811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“虽然应该不需要...嗯...喝下去的话会好一点的啦，对吧夏弥？”笑得很灿烂，“而且味道也不差啦，就当是冰吸薄荷冰奶？”"}
{"time": 1753607885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416255025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9BA480469CFAFC51470EE8DB157DE2BF.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR87eZ2JamSAMfnPIh04oiVX1_aRhiFrQ8g_woo5bb_ttrcjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQyg0mtXE6fjp9u6oWBDfEAXoC5-g&amp;rkey=CAESMDn0rwFP_ihtPJnBj3UoQl8TcF9Nb9LNQ-9zr_-Csl284d0G_PJgUQ5siEb69C6Arg,file_size=251525]"}
