{"time": 1753623830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972171108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实是怪力种子）"}
{"time": 1753623845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261870929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（长得差不多，但是龙不喜欢杀龙果）"}
{"time": 1753623894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545881728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...好像看错了。”收起自己的小镐子，“夏弥，这里的矿脉有多少？”"}
{"time": 1753624014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915959009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1972171108]是一只生长在沙漠或火山等极端环境下的顽强植物。不过在人工环境下也能养。果实吃下后，能影响身体，短暂激发力量"}
{"time": 1753624216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198313137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=545881728]“你是不是被图鉴上的名字影响了啦……我又不能操纵金属”夏弥摊摊手，不过先前抠下的一小团金属已经在她手中逐渐拆解，分成无数细小的锐利碎片"}
{"time": 1753624235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777019329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来是怪力种子啊”"}
{"time": 1753624243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356150802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "采集一下"}
{"time": 1753624257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895215296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但我不是幸运3么）"}
{"time": 1753624262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845106752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么还有这种好事）"}
{"time": 1753624268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642059807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是什么很少见的东西）"}
{"time": 1753624283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110045879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（商店都有卖啊嗯）"}
{"time": 1753624301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833503475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=198313137]“不是的啦，我想的办法当然是靠蛮力把这里的矿脉全部拆掉。”指着眼前的矿脉"}
{"time": 1753624334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387403500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不太像人（）"}
{"time": 1753624582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688759260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=777019329]“这是什么？”沧澜凑到你旁边，看着你收起来的东西。不知道什么时候，她身上没被衣服包裹的地方已经披上了甲"}
{"time": 1753624613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245673796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“吃了可以短暂增加力量，算是点好用的小道具吧”"}
{"time": 1753624627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075993792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟这是我们先发现的嘛，要是不开采完是不是太亏了。\""}
{"time": 1753624791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590769162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，感觉也不需要弄太多?我们也不是很缺钱，随夏弥啦。\""}
{"time": 1753624937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986991599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=245673796]“这样，海里也有类似的东西，吃了能短暂厉害点的鱼”沧澜随着你一起摘了一颗，放进兜里，又现摘一颗随手丢进嘴里"}
{"time": 1753624953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39382699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“味道怎么样”"}
{"time": 1753624958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695481520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好奇的问问"}
{"time": 1753624978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851754587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(嘎嘣脆)"}
{"time": 1753625163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152608349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=590769162]“嗯……”夏弥有一搭没一搭地抠着附近的岩壁，已经抠开将近半米，矿石的颜色变得斑驳起来“先弄个……半方下来吧。多了带起来不方便”"}
{"time": 1753625295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677854616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1695481520]“好难形容”沧澜细细嚼着，眉头因为思考微微皱起，视线无意识上飘“……总之建议你洗一下再吃。吃起来有点像不带肉的鱼”"}
{"time": 1753625342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724685649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉开采出来的部分可以先放在这里。\"在地图上标注一下这个位置的矿脉，\"应该不会遇见什么...小偷?\""}
{"time": 1753625350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539059569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？好...稀奇的比喻”从包里把蜂蜜掏出来“吃点蜂蜜缓一缓吧”"}
