{"time": 1753626075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507423045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2089603256]“ng，那样属性太重复了啦”夏弥鼓起脸，从你手中拿过那块石头“会硌坏牙的”"}
