{"time": 1753627142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981240519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1753627165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310376196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确实有什么在靠近，是某种震颤，某种压迫感十足的生物。还没开始咆哮，地面就先一步发声，碎石开始轻轻颤抖，从步频来看，应该是双足的龙类"}
{"time": 1753627207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655955796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "加快磨刀速度"}
{"time": 1753627304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978698704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...感觉在这地方，这种地况。\"抱到夏弥背后顺势趴在她背上，\"斩龙吧？还是碎龙\""}
{"time": 1753627395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895144233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后准备好闪光弹，准备投掷阶段"}
{"time": 1753627399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123751380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "下巴靠在她的肩膀上，脑袋靠着她的脑袋不安分地蹭蹭，\"露儿小心哦，碎龙的话要小心爆炸孢子，手上嘴里都有，斩的话有点像太刀的战斗方式，注意就好。\""}
{"time": 1753627445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361004255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢安姐姐”但是一直盯着转角，随时准备闪一下"}
{"time": 1753627537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152159748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我们开始战斗吗）"}
{"time": 1753627550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081830977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（闪光小露）"}
{"time": 1753627786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211993884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "终于，硕大的龙头探出拐角，离地两米多高，通体黝黑如墨，看着比山岩坚硬得多，但真的和墨一样反射着油亮的光泽。头上生着一根圆柱状的钝角，直指前方，上面包裹着不知何物的黄绿色物质，颜色似乎还在随呼吸渐变。连面部生长着流线型的甲壳，如同一柄绑着刀锋的大锤。随后探出的是几乎和脑袋一样粗的脖颈，除了下巴连向腹部的连线，几乎都被深靛青的甲壳包裹。它双足行走，身型低伏，包裹着同款黄绿不明物质的前肢几乎要触及地面，但并不锐利。后肢发达，尾部末端均匀生长着六道刃壳，用以平衡前倾的上半身"}
{"time": 1753627810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144134199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=16958D22346A54FBF5563EB9AF47BFCD.jpeg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQo6BZD0vZGlDSSqxq-BsGidtYwXRiRvg4g_woo2Jq41aTdjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQv5HXIfT4Udkb1x8cHp5RFHoCgi8&amp;rkey=CAQSMJd-itETxM8G6YuFzLsvTJFUAv7VSrBNtcy9q5zjJxDEBXNlBYkCyp6rZqCvEdcpZg,file_size=237329]"}
