{"time": 1753631969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422892556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了，怪猎的科学不用太严谨）"}
{"time": 1753631971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64510068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我也不知道，但是游戏是这么说的)"}
{"time": 1753632055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045627252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥扬风，带着你们两个一起绕过地上的黏菌，来到碎龙近前，同时气流携着金属碎片，切割碎龙相对较软的腹部"}
{"time": 1753632058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311625453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+11"}
{"time": 1753632058, "type": "reply", "message_id": "311625453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20+11={19}+11=30"}
{"time": 1753632082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548482252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那下手很狠了）"}
{"time": 1753632167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688489258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "碎龙吃痛后仰，随后很快反应过来压低身形，希望借此藏起自己的腹部。然而气流无孔不入，夏弥也没有留手的打算，不一会鳞片就被刮下来一层，鲜血淋漓"}
{"time": 1753632191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349753056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"老实地被夏弥卷着移动，看到这一幕吐吐舌头，\"下手好凶哦夏弥。\""}
{"time": 1753632408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137391008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊呀，一不小心就……不过看起来夸张而已，这家伙皮很厚的，还伤不到内脏啦”夏弥收回碎刃“不过应该挺疼的就是了”"}
{"time": 1753632413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103735801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "第三轮"}
